    detail
        - Through `Process#startTime`, swallowing a `Pid.Error` as `Unset`; takes an instant type
        - `Instantiable across Instants from Long` (milliseconds). Always `Unset` on Scala Native.
        + Via `Process#startTime`, en absorbant une `Pid.Error` en `Unset` ; prend un type d'instant
        + `Instantiable across Instants from Long` (en millisecondes). Toujours `Unset` sur Scala
